<title>THAILAND: Natural Park Q3 net turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Natural Park Q3 net turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the period ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  Loss	 0.08     vs  Profit   3.91</p>
<p>    Net	   Loss	31.32     vs  Profit 493.17</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  Loss	 0.04     vs  Profit   4.58</p>
<p>    Net	   Loss	14.63     vs  Profit 577.20</p>
<p>NOTES - Company's full name is Natural Park Plc, a property developer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
